        <mxCell id="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-131" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Georgia&quot;&gt;6 -&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If payment object is null when we fetch from redis cache, retrieve the payment object from the Payment History database via a REST API call.&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;endpoint&lt;/b&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 102, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: 600; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;https://&amp;lt;subdomain&amp;gt;.ecsfin.cloud/api/payment-history/payments/history/customer-payments/{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;paymentInstructionId}?partitionDate=??&amp;amp;fetch=??&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-130">
          <mxGeometry width="1198" height="40" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle width="1198" height="40" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-132" value="" style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimlaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;strokeColor=inherit;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;fillColor=none;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;" vertex="1" parent="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-119">
          <mxGeometry y="285" width="1198" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-133" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Georgia&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;7 -&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;If CancelRequest is invalid, it checks whether paymentCore is null; if valid, it first attempts to fetch paymentCore from Redis. Only if Redis returns null, it fetches from the database, and then checks again if paymentCore is null.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=partialRectangle;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;connectable=0;strokeColor=inherit;overflow=hidden;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;pointerEvents=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="10y1DLBOCDB5hXZCW7sR-132">
